package Libraries.Web.Page.Standards

use Libraries.Web.Page.Standards.ComputerScienceStandards2026

/*
    QuorumStandards holds every set of standards the Quorum website maps
    its lessons to, as typed roles: a misspelt set fails to compile. It is
    a shared class, so each set is built once for the whole site, however
    many pages use it. A new set is one more field and one more action.
*/
shared class QuorumStandards
    ComputerScienceStandards2026 computerScience2026

    /*
        Returns the 2026 CSTA K–12 Computer Science Standards.

        Attribute: Returns The set, with a constant for each identifier.
    */
    action GetComputerScience2026 returns ComputerScienceStandards2026
        return computerScience2026
    end
end
